  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Wordless Chorus** (1 other source): The recording is missing the opening track, Wordless Chorus [2]\n- **Off the Record** (1 other source): The second song, Off the Record, is absent from this file [2]\n- **Penny For Your Thoughts** (1 other source): Penny For Your Thoughts is also missing from the provided audio [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Penny For Your Thoughts**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **The Way He Sings**: back after 61 archived shows (1905 days) [4]\n- **Out of Range Pt 2**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2022-09-24.NSL** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 135 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2022-09-24**: source not stated; 1 songs; 119 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorder positioned eight feet high at the back of the pit [1]\n- Listener's girlfriend fainted in the pit, requiring a stranger's help to reach medical [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2022-09-24.NSL**: taped by NSL; transferred by NSL; source: Berliner CM-33's > Tascam DR-60MKII (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with Berliner CM-33s into Tascam DR-60MKII, transferred via Amadeus Pro [1]\n- **mmj2022-09-24**: taped by Amanda Solberg-Bowen [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @1065KISSFM: [My Morning Jacket at Orion Amphitheater | 106.5 Kiss FM | Sep 24th, 2022 | Orion Amphitheater](https://1065kissfm.iheart.com/calendar/content/2022-09-24-my-morning-jacket-at-orion-amphitheater/) [5]\n- Poster by Vsgclothing Official Store: [My Morning Jacket September 24 2022 With Joy Oladokun The Orion Amphitheater Huntsville, Alabama shirt, hoodie, sweater,](https://vsgclothing.com/product/my-morning-jacket-september-24-2022-with-joy-oladokun-the-orion-amphitheater-huntsville-alabama-shirt/) [6]",
